      "updated_at": "2016-05-06T16:35:35Z",
      "body": "Yes, trackException is checking if an object is of type Error - [Util#isError](https://github.com/Microsoft/ApplicationInsights-node.js/blob/master/Library/Util.ts#L97). \n\nDo you have any fix in mind? Would adding a `DoNotLogStackTraces` switch to the configuration work? It will disable stack trace logging for the whole project and will be set to `false` by default. \n",
